                "Description": "Company Health reports employee sync status as Failed. The result code is '${ResultCode}'.",
                "Signals": "[{Name: \"EmployeeStatus\", Value: EmployeeStatus}, {Name: \"EmployeeCount\", Value: EmployeeCount}, {Name: \"EmployeeReason\", Value: EmployeeReason}]",
                "TechnicalExplanation": "Company Health Service sets EmployeeStatus via PayrollEmployeesLoadedEvent — Failed means the payroll-to-Tapcheck employee sync pipeline failed. This affects ALL employees at the company because no employee records can be updated."
              }
            }
          ],
          "default": "Good"
        }
